# dotd's settings: the upstream DNS-over-TLS resolver to forward to, the
# name its certificate must carry, and where the trust roots live in the
# assets view (a path relative to that view). In the drill the upstream
# is the runner's DoT responder, reached through slirp at 10.0.2.100:853,
# presenting the certificate for tls.moss.test.
{ upstream: 10.0.2.100, port: 853, name: tls.moss.test, roots: tls/roots.pem }
